  "description": "Source-generated, reflection-free CQRS/mediator for .NET. Define `IQuery<T>`, `ICommand`, `ICommand<T>` and `IEvent` messages with their handlers, then dispatch through `IDispatcher` with the response type inferred — no runtime reflection and no assembly scanning, so it publishes clean under the WASM/AOT trimmer. Pipeline behaviors provide the decorator hook for cross-cutting logging/validation/transactions. Standalone: depends only on Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions.",
